    "title": "Photos: Stars arrive on the red carpet at the 2026 Oscars",
    "text": "Skip to content by: Lily Dallow Posted: Mar 15, 2026 / 02:20 PM PDT Updated: Mar 15, 2026 / 08:36 PM PDT by: Lily Dallow Posted: Mar 15, 2026 / 02:20 PM PDT Updated: Mar 15, 2026 / 08:36 PM PDT The biggest night in Hollywood was Sunday, and celebrities arrived at the 98th Academy Awards in all their glitz and glam at the Dolby Theatre. Before the trophies were handed out, actors, filmmakers, presenters and nominees stepped onto the Oscars red carpet in one of the most talked-about parts of the night. Designers, stylists and glam teams have spent months preparing for the moment, with stars debuting custom gowns, dramatic suits and bold fashion choices as cameras flash along Hollywood Boulevard. Below are some of the looks from the 2026 Oscars red carpet as celebrities made their way into the ceremony. 2026 Oscars Red Carpet Teyana Taylor arrives at the Oscars on Sunday, March 15, 2026, at the Dolby Theatre in Los Angeles. (Photo by Jordan Strauss/Invision/AP)Teyana Taylor arrives at the Oscars on Sunday, March 15, 2026, at the Dolby Theatre in Los Angeles. (Photo by Jordan Strauss/Invision/AP) This year’s Academy Awards ceremony was hosted by Conan O’Brien, who returned to emcee the event as the film industry celebrated the year’s biggest achievements in cinema. Paul Thomas Anderson’s “One Battle After Another” took home the honor of best picture. Jessie Buckley won best actress and Michael B. Jordan won best actor. Most Popular BestReviews.com - Top picks to make everyone happy Receive the latest news, updates and offers as they happen.",
